{"assets":["/statement-assets/b03950dd7b7ffabd0e590d0bebc789395b52b7e41f1b3ceb68ad2f906751c9b1.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"331","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E2. Deja Vu"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Everybody knows that we have been living in the Matrix for a long time. And in the new seventh Matrix the world is ruled by beavers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So let's take beaver Neo. Neo has so-called \"deja vu\" outbursts when he gets visions of events in some places he's been at or is going to be at. Let's examine the phenomenon in more detail."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We can say that Neo's city is represented by a directed graph, consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" shops and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" streets that connect the shops. No two streets connect the same pair of shops (besides, there can't be one street from A to B and one street from B to A). No street connects a shop with itself. As Neo passes some streets, he gets visions. No matter how many times he passes street "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":", every time he will get the same visions in the same order. A vision is a sequence of shops."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We know that Neo is going to get really shocked if he passes the way from some shop "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" to some shop "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", possible coinciding with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that the list of visited shops in the real life and in the visions coincide."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Suggest beaver Neo such path of non-zero length. Or maybe you can even count the number of such paths modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1000000007"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(109 + 7)"},{"kind":"text","text":"?.."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of shops and the number of streets, correspondingly, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 50"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/b03950dd7b7ffabd0e590d0bebc789395b52b7e41f1b3ceb68ad2f906751c9b1.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the descriptions of the streets in the following format: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v1"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v2"},{"kind":"text","text":" ... "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vk"},{"kind":"text","text":", where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ xi, yi ≤ n, xi ≠ yi)"},{"kind":"text","text":" are numbers of shops connected by a street, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0 ≤ ki ≤ n)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number of visions on the way from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v2"},{"kind":"text","text":", ..., "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vk"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ vi ≤ n)"},{"kind":"text","text":" describe the visions: the numbers of the shops Neo saw. Note that the order of the visions matters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the total number of visions on all streets doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"105"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" to get 50 points, you need to find any (not necessarily simple) path of length at most "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2·n"},{"kind":"text","text":", that meets the attributes described above (subproblem E1); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" to get 50 more points, you need to count for each length from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2·n"},{"kind":"text","text":" the number of paths that have the attribute described above (subproblem E2). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Subproblem E1. In the first line print an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ k ≤ 2·n)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the numbers of shops on Neo's path. In the next line print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers — the number of shops in the order Neo passes them. If the graph doesn't have such paths or the length of the shortest path includes more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2·n"},{"kind":"text","text":" shops, print on a single line "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Subproblem E2. Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2·n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line must contain a single integer — the number of required paths of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1000000007"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(109 + 7)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 6\n1 2 2 1 2\n2 3 1 3\n3 4 2 4 5\n4 5 0\n5 3 1 3\n6 1 1 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n6 1 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 6\n1 2 2 1 2\n2 3 1 3\n3 4 2 4 5\n4 5 0\n5 3 1 3\n6 1 1 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n2\n1\n1\n2\n1\n1\n2\n1\n1\n2\n1"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input in both samples are the same. The first sample contains the answer to the first subproblem, the second sample contains the answer to the second subproblem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E2","problemCode":"331E2","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/331/problem/E2"}